t"}}},{"parameters":{"mode":"raw","jsonOutput":"={\n  \"final_reel_id\": \"{{ $('Upload file').item.json.id }}\"\n}\n","options":{}},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.set","typeVersion":3.4,"position":[1216,160],"id":"ead45829-8aaf-4cc6-bfce-38e744bca979","name":"Return"},{"parameters":{"content":"## Combine audio + audioless clip → subtitles → logo → background music → upload\n\n1️⃣ **Start Trigger**\nReceives **vidoe_audioless_id**, **audio_id**, **segments**, **sub_folder_id**, **logo_url**, **background_music_url**, and **row_number** from the parent workflow. \n\n2️⃣ **Default Values**\nProvides sample IDs/URLs and a sample `segments` array if any inputs are missing. \n\n3️⃣ **Download Assets (Drive)**\nFetches, in order:\n→ **Logo** via **logo_url** (optional)\n→ **Background music** via **background_music_url** (optional)\n→ **Audioless video** via **vidoe_audioless_id**\n→ **Voice audio** via **audio_id**. \n\n4️⃣ **Prepare Binaries (Code)**\nCombines the downloaded binaries into a single item with keys:\n`{ video, audio, logo?, bg_music? }` → ready for HTTP nodes. \n\n5️⃣ **Combine Video & Voice Audio**\nPOST **video** + **audio** to **/combine_video_audio** → outputs a merged MP4. \n\n6️⃣ **Add Word Subtitles**\nPOST merged clip to **/add_word_subtitles** with `segments` (per-word timestamps), with bold text and alignment set. \n\n7️⃣ **Overlay Icon**\nPOST video + **logo** to **/overlay_icon** (alignment, width, opacity configurable) to burn in the logo. \n\n8️⃣ **Add Background Music**\nPOST video (**data**) + **bg_music** to **/combine_video_audio** again (BGM pass) with `fade_out=1` for a clean ending. \n\n9️⃣ **Upload Final Reel (Drive)**\nUploads the finished MP4 to **sub_folder_id** as `final_reel.mp4`; captures Drive links/IDs. \n\n🔟 **Update Google Sheet**\nUpdates **Reel Drive Url** in your `reels_content` sheet, matching the row by **row_number**; then returns the result. \n\n✅ **Finish (Return)**\nOutputs:\n\n```json\n{ \"final_reel_id\": \"<uploaded_file_id>\" }\n```\n","height":1056,"width":528},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[-2496,-96],"typeVersion":1,"id":"43e2561d-86f1-4cb0-8da4-b750dea6b086","name":"Sticky Note"},{"parameters":{"operation":"download","fileId":{"__rl":true,"value":"={{ $('When Executed by Another Workflow').item.json.background_music_url  || $('Default values').item.json.background_music_url_temp}}","mode":"url"},"options":{}},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.googleDrive","typeVersion":3,"position":[-944,160],"id":"0fa1ccfe-a310-4d5e-b885-4092100359aa","name":"Download Background Music","credentials":{"googleDriveOAuth2Api":{"id":"DZNMOm1mlioaH3PJ","name":"Google Drive account"}}},{"parameters":{"method":"POST","url":"http://host.docker.internal:8000/combine_video_audio","sendBody":true,"contentType":"multipart-form-data","bodyParameters":{"parameters":[{"parameterType":"formBinaryData","name":"video","inputDataFieldName":"data"},{"parameterType":"formBinaryData","name":"audio","inputDataFieldName":"bg_music"},{"name":"fade_out","value":"1"}]},"options":{}},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest","typeVersion":4.2,"position":[464,160],"id":"5b207576-8f0a-4618-ad9a-9ebd5599dad0","name":"Add Background Music"},{"parameters":{"jsCode":"// Grab items by node name\nconst [videoItem]    = $items('Download audioless video');\nconst [audioItem]    = $items('Download audio');\nconst [logoItem]     = $items('Download logo');\nconst [bgMusicItem]  = $items('Download Background Music');\nconst [thumbItem]    = $items('Download thumbnail');\n\nif (!videoItem?.binary || !audioItem?.binary) {\n  throw new Error('Missing video or audio binary. Check node names and execution order.');\n}\n\n// Extract binary data (fallbacks included)\nconst videoBin   = videoItem.binary.video ?? videoItem.binary.data;\nconst audioBin   = audioItem.binary.audio ?? audioItem.binary.data;\nconst logoBin    = logoItem?.binary?.logo ?? logoItem?.binary?.data;\nconst bgMusicBin = bgMusicItem?.binary?.bg_music ?? bgMusicItem?.binary?.data;\n\n// Thumbnail fallbacks: try 'thumbnail', then 'image', then generic 'data'\nconst thumbnailBin =\n  thumbItem?.binary?.thumbnail ??\n  thumbItem?.binary?.image ??\n  thumbItem?.binary?.data ?? null;\n\n// Return all binaries together\nreturn [{\n  json: {},\n  binary: {\n    video: videoBin,\n    audio: audioBin,\n    ...(logoBin ? { logo: logoBin } : {}),\n    ...(bgMusicBin ? { bg_music: bgMusicBin } : {}),\n    ...(thumbnailBin ? { thumbnail: thumbnailBin } : {}), // include thumbnail if available\n  },\n}];\n"},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","typeVersion":2,"position":[-352,160],"id":"e1989e84-521e-43b5-a60e-8f83e334190a","name":"Rename files"},{"parameters":{"operation":"update","documentId":{"__rl":true,"value":"1aVtz3h8M_JDN68ST4AL45byajYpelAoI3qVqDg0f4XM","mode":"list","cachedResultName":"reels_content","cachedResultUrl":"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1aVtz3h8M_JDN68ST4AL45byajYpelAoI3qVqDg0f4XM/edit?usp=drivesdk"},"sheetName":{"__rl":true,"value":"gid=0","mode":"list","cachedResultName":"Sheet1","cachedResultUrl":"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1aVtz3h8M_JDN68ST4AL45byajYpelAoI3qVqDg0f4XM/edit#gid=0"},"columns":{"mappingMode":"defineBelow","value":{"row_number":"={{ $('When Executed by Another Workflow').item.json.row_number || $('Default values').item.json.row_number_temp}}","Reel Drive Url":"={{ $json.webViewLink }}"},"matchingColumns":["row_number"],"schema":[{"id":"Topic","displayName":"Topic","required":false,"defaultMatch":false,"display":true,"type":"string","canBeUsedToMatch":true,"removed":true},{"id":"Language","displayName":"Language","required":false,"defaultMatch":false,"display":true,"type":"string","canBeUsedToMatch":true,"removed":true},{"id":"Voice Id","displayName":"Voice Id","required":false,"defaultMatch":false,"display":true,"type":"string","canBeUsedToMatch":true,"removed":true},{"id":"Voice Model","displayName":"Voice Model","required":false,"defaultMatch":false,"display":true,"type":"string","canBeUsedToMatc